# Run a trivial program to completion and inspect the resulting operand stack.
#
# The VM requires <= 16 elements on the stack at program end. The operand stack
# starts as 16 padding zeros, so the trailing `add` folds the 7 into a padding
# zero (7 + 0 = 7), keeping the final depth at 16 and terminating cleanly.
begin
    push.3
    push.4
    add
    add
end
---
continue
# CHECK: Program terminated successfully
stack
# CHECK: Operand Stack
# CHECK: [0] 7
# CHECK-NOT: Error
